  "summary": [
    "Pre-search judgment: rebuild not needed, rebuild needed, or undeterminable, independent of the search backend",
    "ToC backend flow: user chooses rebuild-then-search or search the existing version, with scale counts and detail file",
    "Target specification file passed via --target-file so AI does not copy specs",
    "Undeterminable state is a failure; search stops and no old version is offered",
    "Search result contract: document ID, path, relevance yes or maybe, reason, sections, key, ToC version, freshness",
    "Search AI workers read every document one at a time; script splits assignments and shows only titles, purposes, summaries, tasks, keywords, headings",
    "Answer validation: closed words yes, maybe, no; heading resolution by normalized exact or unique prefix match; no silent repair",
    "Completion requires an answer for every document; result order is the assignment order, not relevance",
    "resolve-dlid: resolves document and section DLIDs from recorded paths, verifies against actual files, adds content hash",
    "Resolution outcomes: resolved, not at recorded path, no record; no writes to ToC, state, or documents"
  ],
  "tasks": [
